OL,3,AThe Trip's Rob Brydon originally
OL,4,Aagainst playing fictional version of
OL,5,Ahimself
OL,6,
OL,7,FActor and comedian Rob Brydon has said
OL,8,Fhe was initially against the idea of
OL,9,Fplaying a fictionalised version of
OL,10,Fhimself in The Trip, but ended up
OL,11,Fenjoying it and thought it made viewers
OL,12,F"more curious".
OL,14,FThe 61-year-old, known for his role as
OL,15,FUncle Bryn in Gavin and Stacey, stars
OL,16,Falongside Steve Coogan in the comedy
OL,17,Fseries as exaggerated versions of
OL,18,Fthemselves.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
