OL,3,AThe Trip's Rob Brydon originally
OL,4,Aagainst playing fictional version of
OL,5,Ahimself
OL,6,
OL,7,FDirected by Michael Winterbottom, it
OL,8,Ffollows the pair as they travel around
OL,9,Fthe world and dine at different
OL,10,Frestaurants.
OL,12,FBrydon said he and Coogan originally
OL,13,Fthought the idea was "a bit passe" but
OL,14,Feventually concluded that Winterbottom
OL,15,Fwas right to suggest it.
